  "content": "<p data-pid=\"ckFwGFfk\">第三章<span class=\"nolink\">《人类词语指南》</span>探讨了认知与概念形成之间的基本关系。</p><p data-pid=\"t3pj37Tv\">——<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Minds-An-Introduction\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《心智：导读》</a><sup data-text=\"理性：序言\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2016579299948393369\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup>by Rob Bensinger</p><hr/><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2046246707919427546\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"匕首的寓言\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e22441ea6421456fd76808ef2c657b8d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">匕首的寓言</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2046571422441649104\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"毒芹的寓言\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8763d58dd3ab82ff4495d268d4c05dd8.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">毒芹的寓言</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2047287465292075697\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"词语暗含的推理\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b454f2efedc25f56b8427e005b5595f6.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">词语暗含的推理</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2048453159417386565\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"外延与内涵\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b3ab67c959a55a7f97d346713a01417b.jpeg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">外延与内涵</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2048702726998061622\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"相似性聚类\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-21b2742b36b63bdb84820ff120931ccc.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">相似性聚类</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2049178769492125521\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"典型性与不对称相似性\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-148165a36b7a592715cdc7017dde5c62.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">典型性与不对称相似性</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2050179140419072823\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"事物空间的聚类结构\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e41918909bab7453220ba638aa7e2fa8.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">事物空间的聚类结构</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2050519448814195814\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"伪装的查询\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-943aba2bfa707c783995709d67737df7.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">伪装的查询</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2050999897550223000\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"神经类别\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9a37f719e216483ba877f5f7cf570f56.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">神经类别</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2051369757249736864\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"一个算法的内部感受\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9a37f719e216483ba877f5f7cf570f56.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">一个算法的内部感受</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2051788159038576630\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"争论定义\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-21d5613945c1eacbeb903cb9b7619d4d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">争论定义</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2052143475601281650\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"感受「意义」\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-0739b4adc98355ad4ad2f958b09d4b21.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">感受「意义」</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2052688537791750991\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"诉诸普遍用法的论点\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-08bcb24cf56008eaa3a64f7fa04ac27f.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">诉诸普遍用法的论点</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2053166730122360454\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"空标签\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6af6d47531dbab47003891b7389e4595.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">空标签</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2054686580703498406\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"设置你的敏感词\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-33a7caf5bdf7368635559d6d456e12d9.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">设置你的敏感词</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2054864033602393512\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"用实质代替符号\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9245b895827b8658439831ec3bb384ef.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">用实质代替符号</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2055264755414218095\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"压缩的谬误\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-654703243ef3f62a4219b1473a1b25fb.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">压缩的谬误</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2055741825474990452\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"分类本身就有后果\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0493c31de47d476973ca13d2cd5a794d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">分类本身就有后果</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2055957959021171732\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"夹带内涵\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9eebfae3024fde2b923bb32a5071cfe8.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">夹带内涵</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2056323453402231148\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"「根据定义」的争论\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-72901476c24fa113def6efe373411df1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">「根据定义」的争论</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2057532415229301412\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"在哪里划定边界？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c4883c4058fbc54c0875f5f3200ec33c.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">在哪里划定边界？</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2057779518157370998\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"熵与简短的编码\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-78c6b9788cf9d6999f87b0dcb2d35252.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">熵与简短的编码</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2059600041661272639\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"互信息与事物空间中的密度\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3c9b77495449d8edb5204982901b96be.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">互信息与事物空间中的密度</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2060303864029615597\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"超指数级的概念空间与简单的词语\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-57b49f0c37d61df56bd5a2237f92cfbb.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">超指数级的概念空间与简单的词语</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2061023443156522584\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"条件独立与朴素贝叶斯\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0e371eb8340b9e228a09e8c9e1538f2e.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">条件独立与朴素贝叶斯</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2061380437788865753\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"作为心智画笔抓手的词语\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7e4eda30671b4f8c6afe93e3841fa056.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">作为心智画笔抓手的词语</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2061943119130661690\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"变量问题谬误\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c14e5c7c8d7338a1e70a5e53d9491a54.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">变量问题谬误</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2062240524812260000\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"词语可能出错的 37 种方式\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ffa585c44a3d653ab1dc2c011ae176af.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">词语可能出错的 37 种方式</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"EuqfykFh\">总目录：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2056344770390373406\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\"internal\">《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录</a><p data-pid=\"l6MR_xs6\">卷：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2063193105831141740\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"第三卷：灵魂中的机械\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\"internal\">第三卷：灵魂中的机械</a><p data-pid=\"CVjcbhGs\">上一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2044842612071339196\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"迷失的目的\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-630beab9a69308a7da0c5b997849be72.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">迷失的目的</a><p data-pid=\"CNnHRPNn\">下一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2046246707919427546\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"匕首的寓言\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e22441ea6421456fd76808ef2c657b8d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">匕首的寓言</a>